{"content_hash": "b012062ad4c6004c", "version_id": 782, "article_id": 79, "level_code": "en_a2", "lang": "en", "level": 2, "level_label": "A2 初级", "title": "Kane wins Ballon d'Or as Putellas takes third award", "title_zh": "凯恩捧起金球奖，普特利亚斯第三次获奖", "has_translation": true, "topic": "sports", "source": "guardian_sport", "source_url": "https://www.theguardian.com/football/live/2026/oct/26/ballon-dor-2026-updates-from-70th-edition-in-london-live", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1711234186672-00cfb626ea33?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Mnx8YmFsbG9uJTIwaGFycnl8ZW58MHwwfHx8MTc5MzA2MTcyMnww&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Rob Griffin on Unsplash", "author": "Rob Griffin", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@rgartprjkt?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-person-holding-a-red-balloon-with-a-picture-on-it-gwdbwUC-mLU?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(214, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(252, 46%, 48%)", "label": "SPORTS", "seed": "131ee3a62343"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-27", "word_count": 140, "reading_minutes": 0.7, "lead": "Harry Kane won the men's Ballon d'Or in London on Monday. Alexia Putellas won the women's award for the third time.", "lead_zh": "周一，哈里·凯恩在伦敦获得男子金球奖。阿莱克西亚·普特利亚斯第三次获得女子金球奖。", "preview": "Kane plays for Bayern Munich and England. He is the first Englishman to win the award in 25 years. Last season, he scored 77 goals in 68 gam", "preview_zh": "凯恩效力于拜仁慕尼黑和英格兰队。他是25年来第一位获得该奖项的英格兰人。上赛季，他在68场比赛中打进77球。他在长长的获奖感言中感谢了家人和队友。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 765, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/79/en_a2.mp3", "duration": 48.8, "size_bytes": 293760, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 159, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/79/en_a2_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 50.125, "size_bytes": 301680, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 159, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/79/en_a2_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/79/en_a2_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 53.25, "size_bytes": 320400, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 159, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/79/en_a2_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/79/en_a2_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 46.475, "size_bytes": 279792, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 159, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/79/en_a2_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/79/en_a2_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 49.225, "size_bytes": 296352, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 159, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/79/en_a2_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@e17722d/content/data/versions/782.json", "paragraphs": ["Kane plays for Bayern Munich and England. He is the first Englishman to win the award in 25 years. Last season, he scored 77 goals in 68 games. He thanked his family and teammates in a long speech.", "Putellas plays for Barcelona and Spain. She won the women's award before, in 2021 and 2022. She also plays for London City Lionesses. This year, the ceremony took place in London.", "Many other prizes were given out. Paris Saint-Germain won men's club of the year for the second time. Barcelona won women's club of the year. Bukayo Saka won the Socrates award for his charity, Big Shoe.", "Lamine Yamal won men's young talent of the year for the third time. Vicky Lopez won the women's young talent award for the second year. Luis de la Fuente was men's coach of the year."], "paragraphs_zh": ["凯恩效力于拜仁慕尼黑和英格兰队。他是25年来第一位获得该奖项的英格兰人。上赛季，他在68场比赛中打进77球。他在长长的获奖感言中感谢了家人和队友。", "普特利亚斯效力于巴塞罗那和西班牙队。她曾在2021年和2022年获得女子金球奖。她也为伦敦城雌狮队踢球。今年的颁奖典礼在伦敦举行。", "当晚还颁发了许多其他奖项。巴黎圣日耳曼第二次获得年度最佳男足俱乐部。巴塞罗那获得年度最佳女足俱乐部。萨卡凭借他的“大鞋”慈善项目获得苏格拉底奖。", "亚马尔第三次获得年度最佳男子新秀。洛佩斯连续第二年获得女子新秀奖。德拉富恩特当选年度最佳男足教练。"], "body": "Kane plays for Bayern Munich and England. He is the first Englishman to win the award in 25 years. Last season, he scored 77 goals in 68 games. He thanked his family and teammates in a long speech.\n\nPutellas plays for Barcelona and Spain. She won the women's award before, in 2021 and 2022. She also plays for London City Lionesses. This year, the ceremony took place in London.\n\nMany other prizes were given out. Paris Saint-Germain won men's club of the year for the second time. Barcelona won women's club of the year. Bukayo Saka won the Socrates award for his charity, Big Shoe.\n\nLamine Yamal won men's young talent of the year for the third time. Vicky Lopez won the women's young talent award for the second year. Luis de la Fuente was men's coach of the year.", "body_zh": "凯恩效力于拜仁慕尼黑和英格兰队。他是25年来第一位获得该奖项的英格兰人。上赛季，他在68场比赛中打进77球。他在长长的获奖感言中感谢了家人和队友。\n\n普特利亚斯效力于巴塞罗那和西班牙队。她曾在2021年和2022年获得女子金球奖。她也为伦敦城雌狮队踢球。今年的颁奖典礼在伦敦举行。\n\n当晚还颁发了许多其他奖项。巴黎圣日耳曼第二次获得年度最佳男足俱乐部。巴塞罗那获得年度最佳女足俱乐部。萨卡凭借他的“大鞋”慈善项目获得苏格拉底奖。\n\n亚马尔第三次获得年度最佳男子新秀。洛佩斯连续第二年获得女子新秀奖。德拉富恩特当选年度最佳男足教练。", "text": "Kane plays for Bayern Munich and England. He is the first Englishman to win the award in 25 years. Last season, he scored 77 goals in 68 games. He thanked his family and teammates in a long speech. Putellas plays for Barcelona and Spain. She won the women's award before, in 2021 and 2022. She also plays for London City Lionesses. This year, the ceremony took place in London. Many other prizes were given out. Paris Saint-Germain won men's club of the year for the second time. Barcelona won women's club of the year. Bukayo Saka won the Socrates award for his charity, Big Shoe. Lamine Yamal won men's young talent of the year for the third time. Vicky Lopez won the women's young talent award for the second year. Luis de la Fuente was men's coach of the year.", "vocab": [{"word": "award", "pos": "noun", "zh": "奖项", "note": "常与 win 搭配：win an award", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "win", "pos": "verb", "zh": "赢得", "note": "过去式 won，不规则变化", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "ceremony", "pos": "noun", "zh": "典礼", "note": "颁奖典礼常说 award ceremony", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "score", "pos": "verb", "zh": "进球", "note": "体育报道里常用", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "teammate", "pos": "noun", "zh": "队友", "note": "team + mate 组合词", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "charity", "pos": "noun", "zh": "慈善机构", "note": "做慈善可说 do charity work", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "coach", "pos": "noun", "zh": "教练", "note": "也可作动词，表示“训练”", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "third", "pos": "adj", "zh": "第三的", "note": "序数词，前面常加 the", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-10-27T00:42:00.481318", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "Kane", "s": 0.275, "e": 0.55, "sm": 275, "em": 550, "cs": 0, "ce": 4, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "plays", "s": 0.55, "e": 0.875, "sm": 550, "em": 874, "cs": 5, "ce": 10, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "for", "s": 0.875, "e": 1.0, "sm": 875, "em": 1000, "cs": 11, "ce": 14, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "Bayern", "s": 1.0, "e": 1.4, "sm": 1000, "em": 1399, "cs": 15, "ce": 21, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "Munich", "s": 1.4, "e": 1.8, "sm": 1400, "em": 1799, "cs": 22, "ce": 28, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "and", "s": 1.8, "e": 1.925, "sm": 1800, "em": 1925, "cs": 29, "ce": 32, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "England", "s": 1.925, "e": 2.675, "sm": 1925, "em": 2674, "cs": 33, "ce": 40, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": ".", "s": 2.675, "e": 2.775, "sm": 2675, "em": 2775, "cs": 40, "ce": 41, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": "He", "s": 2.775, "e": 2.887, "sm": 2775, "em": 2887, "cs": 42, 